	(text "FC outputs\nS1-S4   lift motors, DShot600, via the ESC 8-pin plug\nS5-S8   tilt servos FR, RL, FL, RR, 50 Hz\nS9-S10  left / right wheel command to the ESP32, 50 Hz\nS11     spare.   UART2 = ELRS.   UART3 free for GPS.\n\nWheel drive\nS9/S10 send 1000-2000 us pulses, 1500 = stop. The ESP32 reads\nthem on IO34/IO35 and drives each TB6612 input pair with\n20 kHz PWM: IN1 = forward, IN2 = reverse. STBY, PWMA and PWMB\nare tied to 3.3 V. No pulses for 200 ms -> all IN low, wheels stop."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19 306 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "932a909c-6120-5438-9a63-cfe2fb2cccbd")
	)
